# core.autocrlf is on for this repo, and Git decides text-versus-binary by
# heuristic when nothing here says otherwise. It currently guesses these
# correctly, but a decoder or model corrupted by line-ending translation
# fails at runtime in the browser with nothing pointing back at the commit
# that broke it. State it instead of relying on the guess.
*.wasm binary
*.glb  binary
*.gltf binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.db   binary
